 "summaries": [
  {
   "version": "Introduced in House",
   "date": "2022-07-27",
   "text": "Responsible Gun Ownership Licensing Act\n This bill establishes a federal firearm licensing program through which an individual must obtain a federal firearm license from the Department of Justice prior to purchasing or receiving a firearm. To be eligible for such a license, the individual must have completed training in firearms safety and be subject to a background investigation and criminal history check."
  }
